  "fullDescription": "Step into a timeless era of design with the Block Retro font, a classic display typeface that captures the bold, confident spirit of mid-century advertising.\n\nThis Block Retro typeface features thick, rounded slabs with a clean outline effect, making it an excellent choice for varsity-style apparel, retro cafe branding, and classic movie titles. As a Block Retro font, it brings a sense of nostalgia and “vintage cool” to any modern project.\n\nThe balanced geometry of the Block Retro typeface makes it incredibly easy to read and work with across various mediums. It is the perfect anchor for a vintage “badge” logo or a bold website header that needs a touch of heritage. Pair the Block Retro font with a thin script for a sophisticated “high-low” contrast, or keep it purely classic with a complementary serif.",
